        <mxCell id="life3" value="token / guard / …" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6554C0;fontColor=#172B4D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1272.5" y="585" width="157.5" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="afterTotal" value="按需绑定未物化时，每方法新增：GC heap 32 B + 独立 recipe allocation&lt;div&gt;recipe payload 16 B；allocator actual 按目标实现计费&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;另有 8 B/目标方法 directory 与每类 lifetime/registry 固定成本&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;此时不分配 native 函数对象图&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacing=8;fillColor=#E3FCEF;strokeColor=#00875A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172B4D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="675" width="630" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arrayNote" value="每个 LAZY entry 独立拥有 recipe block：LAZY(ptr) → MATERIALIZING(ptr) → DONE；发布 DONE 后立即释放该 recipe。directory 到全部终态、批量终止或 unload 时整体释放。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFAE6;strokeColor=#FFAB00;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172B4D;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="780" width="630" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="lifeBand" value="对象生命周期变化" style="swimlane;html=1;horizontal=1;startSize=34;rounded=0;fillColor=#F4F5F7;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B778C;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#172B4D;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="890" width="1420" height="285" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t0" value="T0 define_class 注册完成&lt;div&gt;两路径 HClass / LayoutInfo 已按相同 key / attrs 填充&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;当前 slot = JSFunction；按需 slot = accessor，另持有 recipe / directory / lifetime&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;临时 keys / attrs / descriptors 生命周期结束&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;spacing=7;fillColor=#DEEBFF;strokeColor=#0052CC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172B4D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="75" y="950" width="300" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t1" value="T1  首次读取方法槽&lt;br&gt;创建 JSFunction + JSNativePointer + NapiFunctionInfo；同槽写回 JSFunction ref；HClass / LayoutInfo 不变；directory 发布 DONE 后释放 recipe" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;spacing=7;fillColor=#E3FCEF;strokeColor=#00875A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172B4D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="425" y="950" width="300" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t2" value="T2  稳态 / 批量终止&lt;br&gt;物化后的闭包三件套按普通对象生命周期存在；已物化槽无 recipe；全部 entry 终态或批量终止后释放 directory/token" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;spacing=7;fillColor=#EAE6FF;strokeColor=#6554C0;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172B4D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="775" y="950" width="300" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t3" value="T3  env / module unload&lt;br&gt;lifetime 先置 DEAD，阻止新 guard/物化；现有 guard 排空后释放剩余 recipe、directory 与 token；data 为 non-owning，不释放目标资源" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;spacing=7;fillColor=#FFEBE6;strokeColor=#DE350B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172B4D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1125" y="950" width="300" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eT0" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0052CC;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t0" target="t1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eT1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#00875A;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t1" target="t2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eT2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#6554C0;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t2" target="t3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="footer" value="&lt;b&gt;尺寸口径&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;快照观测：JSFunction 112/144 B、JSNativePointer 40 B；ABI：NapiFunctionInfo 32/40 B&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;设计：NapiLazyAccessor 32 B、recipe payload 16 B、directory 8 B/slot；allocator metadata 与每类 registry/lifetime 固定头单独实测&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5E6C84;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="75" y="1095" width="1350" height="65" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
